  "content": "<p>此模组需要 <strong>MixinBootstrap</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmixinbootstrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>) 才能运行！<br>\n<strong>Mixin 0.7-0.8 兼容性</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-0-7-0-8-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmixincompat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>) 可能在另一个模组使用较旧的 mixin 版本且因此无法启动游戏时有所帮助。</p>\n<p><strong>RenderLib</strong> 是一个仅客户端的模组，为我的一些其他模组做实体和 TileEntity 渲染的必要更改。\n单独使用时，本模组不会提供任何有意义的性能提升，您可能只有在安装依赖此模组的模组时才希望安装它。</p>\n<p>您可以查看我带有此模组作为依赖项的模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Entity Culling</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-culling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fentity-culling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>) - 跳过被方块遮挡的实体的渲染</li>\n<li><strong>Nothirium</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nothirium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fnothirium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>) - 通过使用现代 OpenGL 进行区块渲染大幅提高 FPS</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您想将 RenderLib 与 TickDynamic 一起使用，请检查这个与 RenderLib 兼容的 TickDynamic 分支：<strong>Tick Dynamic Continuation</strong> (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tick-dynamic-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">curseforge</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftick-dynamic-continuation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modrinth</a>)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXgPJnJafP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"139\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmeldexun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-F06060?logo=ko-fi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"ko-fi\" width=\"111\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/meldexun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-FFC34C?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"patreon\" width=\"143\"></a></p>",
